## The Kitchen

@narrator{code="0010"}: The kitchen is warm and loud with a kettle about to sing.
@cook{code="0010"}: If you're here about that spoon, I've been at the oven all afternoon.

<hub id="askCook" prompt="What do you ask Mrs. Dunn?">
  <choice id="oven" text="Ask what she was baking" once into="run.tastedCake">
    @cook{code="0020"}: Seed cake. The vicar's favourite.
  </choice>
  <choice id="scullery" text="Peek into the scullery" once>
    @narrator{code="0020"}: A tray of washed spoons. Five of them.
    ::set{run.cluesFound += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" text="Thank her and go" exit>
    @cook{code="0030"}: Mind the step.
  </choice>
</hub>
